/P 263 0 R
/E (This indexing design allows for rapid, reliable, and consistent artifact cycling along with reliable shooter performance. The indexing design accomplished this by using independently controlled motors, increasing wheel contact, and controlling compression that will minimize jamming of the artifacts while providing a higher level of consistency in scores during both Autonomous and TELEOP parts of matches.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
